  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya, Rwanda. The project aims to increase awareness on the topic of human trafficking. They want to acheive this both by building capacity within the general poulation in their communities in Kenya and Rwanda. They also want to work towards influencing policy makers in order to improve policies on migration and to support the victims of human trafficing.</narrative>
  </description>
